### Step 1: Understand the Code Snippet

The provided code snippet involves starting a kernel thread:

```c
void uwbd_start(struct uwb_rc *rc)
{
	struct task_struct *task = kthread_run(uwbd, rc, "uwbd");
	if (IS_ERR(task)) {
		rc->uwbd.task = NULL;
